            <ArticleTitle>Application of stem cell technology for coronary artery disease at the All India Institute of Medical Sciences, New Delhi, India.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>E231-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Stem cell technology is rapidly gaining popularity as a way to improve the prognosis of patients with coronary artery disease and heart failure. In this review, we systematically analyze the basis, methods, and results of stem cell technology for coronary artery disease at the All India Institute of Medical Sciences, New Delhi, India.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
